      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwadiŋi iyala wakwituŋa daEfweremi damapidi, ijina dindi Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamwilili mama yindi nindi, Awa mali asiliva makulakaji ikuminadimu akunonenenuwu, iwashiŋeneni, iwateneni ami nichitiyaŋa, tala dinusiliva yina yami nidi nayu, yami nanoneni. Mama yindi nindi, Yowumwanami! Akukiswili kudi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamufuntishilili mama yindi maliana makulakaji ikumi nadimu. Kutiya mama yindi nindi, Siliva yina ami namujilikiliyi Yehova yakufuma kuchikasa chami yamwanami, yakwila nachu mukishi wakusoŋa nimukishi wakusuŋununa; dichi dinu nukukufuntishilayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chamufuntishililiyu mama yindi owu mali, mama yindiwanonenuku siliva makulakaji ayedi, wenkeli muchi, niyena hakwila nachu mukishi wakusoŋa nimukishi wakusuŋununa; ashakamini mwitala daMika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yenowu iyala Mika wadiŋi netala dawakishi, watuŋili niifwodininkishi jakupanda, wajilikili nimwanindi weyala wumu, ekali kapristukindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyakoyu, mumpata yaIsarela himwadiŋi mwanta walukanuku; antu ejima mwomwafuukwiluwu awenawu nawu munawahi, dimu mweliluwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwadiŋi mukwenzi weyala wakuBetelemi Yuda, wakuchisaka chaYuda, wadiŋi kaLevi, wayili nakushakama kwenoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yenowu iyala wafuminikumukala, wenowu waBetelemi Yuda, kulonda ayi nakushakama kwonsukwakamonayi kwoku; chendeliyi, washi kili kwituŋa daEfweremi damapidi, nikwitala daMika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mika wamwilili nindi, Kuwukufuma kudihi? Yena nindi, NikaLevi wakuBetelemi Yuda, hinukuya nakushakama kwonsukunamoni kwoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mika wamwilili nindi, Shakamaku nanami, wikalitata yami nikapristu kami, ami nakakwinkaŋa hamwaka mali asiliva ikumi, nichakuvwala nichakudya. KaLevi etŋia nikwitŋia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KaLevi wetiyilikushakama nayenowu iyala; owu mukwenzi welili neyi himwanindi wakudisemena ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mika wajilikili kaLevi, owu mukwenzi welili kapristu kindi, washakamini mwitala daMika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Mika welili nindi, Ichi dinu nelukinami Yehova wakaŋila chachiwahi nanichi chinikweti kapristu kami waka-Levi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
